"Project-Id-Version: JusPrin\n"
"Report-Msgid-Bugs-To: \n"
"POT-Creation-Date: 2026-11-15 18:58-0800\n"
"PO-Revision-Date: YEAR-MO-DA HO:MI+ZONE\n"
